Scoped Loki SDL MJPEG (SMJPEG) muxer, audio only

The magic, chunk tags, header layout (_TXT, _SND, HEND), per-packet sndD
chunks, trailer (DONE) and duration field in src/smjpeg.ts follow
libavformat/smjpegenc.c (smjpeg_write_header, smjpeg_write_packet,
smjpeg_write_trailer), smjpeg.h (SMJPEG_MAGIC and chunk tags) and
smjpeg.c (ff_codec_smjpeg_audio_tags). The millisecond timestamps follow
libavutil/mathematics.c (av_rescale_rnd, AV_ROUND_NEAR_INF).
